flowchart TD
    Client["Gaming Client"] -->|Score updates & Rank queries| API["API Gateway / LB"]
    
    API --> ScoreService["Score Service"]
    API --> RankService["Rank Lookup Service"]

    ScoreService -->|Write async to log| Kafka["Kafka Event Stream\n(Durability)"]
    ScoreService -->|ZINCRBY composite score| RedisPrimary["Redis (Primary)\nSorted Set\n(leaderboard:tournament_id)"]
    
    Kafka -->|Consume events| DBWorker["DB Persist Worker"]
    DBWorker -->|Batch Write| MySQL[("MySQL\n(Source of Truth)")]
    
    RankService -->|ZREVRANK, ZREVRANGE| RedisPrimary
    RedisPrimary -->|Replicate| RedisReplica["Redis (Replica)"]
    RankService -->|Fallback / Read Scale| RedisReplica
    
    subgraph Data Stores
        RedisPrimary
        RedisReplica
        MySQL
    end
